      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "Prompt：\n\nA long-exposure photograph mimicking traditional Chinese \"Da Tie Hua\" (molten iron fireworks), based on the visual analysis of [reference_image_filename].\n\nSubject Isolation and Transformation: The primary motion subject(s) are first isolated from the reference image,…",
